Hi Caroline,

Thank you for this morning. I've attached Siobhan's slides as a PDF for you t=
o circulate.

As agreed, we'll prepare the four-week trial at Trafford T2 and Warrington W1=
 first and hold off on seeking another feeder quotation. The trial will use t=
he same first-off approval checks on both lines and record changeover and res=
tart losses separately.

Could you send us the name of one shift lead for each line by Friday 11 Octob=
er? Once we have both names, Siobhan can confirm who will keep the shift reco=
rds and who will check them each week. We can then agree the start date with =
you.

Best,
Nicholas

